---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="noui.si, Prakash Upadhyay" description="noui.si, an early exploration of interfaces that assemble themselves around what you need." current="work" progress>
<section aria-labelledby="page-title" style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="position: relative; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 80px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px">
<p style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)"><span><a href="/work" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none">Work</a></span><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>noui.si</span></p>
<h1 id="page-title" style="margin: 0; color: var(--display); font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 0.98">noui.si</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px); font-weight: 300; color: var(--text-muted)">Intent. Context. Outcome.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text)">An early exploration of interfaces that assemble themselves around what you need, instead of making you learn a fixed screen.</p>
</div>
</section>

<main style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 72px clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 120px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px 64px; align-items: flex-start">
<div style="flex: 1 1 560px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<img src="/images/noui/hero.png" alt="The noui.si home page: What if software stopped making you learn its interface? Interfaces that adapt to your intent and context." width="1200" height="630" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-card-lg)" />
</div>
<aside aria-label="Project facts" style="flex: 0 1 300px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Role</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink)">Idea, design and build, solo</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Stack</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink)">Vite · React 19 · Tailwind v4 · View Transitions API</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Hosting</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink)">Cloudflare Pages, no backend</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Status</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink)">Early exploration · 2026</p></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 12px"><a href="https://noui.si" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Try it on noui.si<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a><a href="https://noui.si/listen/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Watch the voice prototype<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/upadhyayprakash/noui-orb" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">noui-orb on GitHub<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a></div>
</aside>
</div>

<section aria-labelledby="q-title" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px">
<h2 id="q-title" style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; font-weight: var(--weight-label); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); display: flex; gap: 14px">The question</h2>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line)"></div>
</div>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 900px; color: var(--display); font-size: clamp(32px, 4.4vw, 56px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.03em">What if software stopped making you learn its interface?</p>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 680px; font-size: 18px">Software today gives you a screen. noui explores what happens when the interface emerges around your intent: built for one task, then set aside.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-card-lg); overflow: hidden"><div style="flex: 1 1 320px; background: transparent; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Today</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--display)">Fixed interface</p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted)">You learn the software, then work through it.</p><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0"><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">01</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400">Navigate</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">02</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400">Search</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">03</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400">Configure</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">04</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 400">Operate</span></li></ul></div><div style="flex: 1 1 320px; background: var(--surface); padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">noui</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--display)">Emergent interface</p><p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted)">You say what you need, and the interface forms around it.</p><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0"><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">→</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500">Describe</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">→</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500">Intent</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">→</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500">Context</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; height: 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)"><span style="width: 24px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted)">→</span><span style="font-size: 18px; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 500">Outcome</span></li></ul></div></div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="how-title" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px">
<h2 id="how-title" style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; font-weight: var(--weight-label); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); display: flex; gap: 14px">How the experiment works</h2>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line)"></div>
</div>
<ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px"><li style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Intent</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">Say the task in your own words.</span></li><li aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; align-items: center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--control-border)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></li><li style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h10"></path><path d="M18 7h2"></path><circle cx="16" cy="7" r="2"></circle><path d="M4 17h4"></path><path d="M12 17h8"></path><circle cx="10" cy="17" r="2"></circle></svg><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Context</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">Answer one question: what matters most?</span></li><li aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; align-items: center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--control-border)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></li><li style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path><path d="M10 9v11"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Interface</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">Panels assemble for this one task.</span></li><li aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; align-items: center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--control-border)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></li><li style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 11a8 8 0 0 0-14.3-4.9L4 8"></path><path d="M4 4v4h4"></path><path d="M4 13a8 8 0 0 0 14.3 4.9L20 16"></path><path d="M20 20v-4h-4"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Changes</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">Change your mind halfway through.</span></li><li aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; align-items: center"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--control-border)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></li><li style="flex: 1 1 160px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9.5"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Outcome</span><span style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">One clear next action.</span></li></ol>
<p style="margin: 0; max-width: 760px; font-size: 18px">When you change your mind, the interface changes its <strong style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600">structure</strong>, not just its numbers: panels appear, move or leave, and morph into place with the View Transitions API. With reduced motion on, they simply swap.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="sc-title" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px">
<h2 id="sc-title" style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; font-weight: var(--weight-label); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); display: flex; gap: 14px">Three scenarios</h2>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line)"></div>
</div>
<ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(320px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px"><li style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">You say</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.3">“Plan a 3-day trip to Kyoto”</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">What matters most?</p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px"><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Affordable</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Comfortable</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">See the most</span></div><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Then you change your mind</p><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0"><li style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">“Actually, I'm travelling with my parents”</li><li style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">“Actually, keep the whole trip under $1,200”</li></ul></li>
<li style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">You say</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.3">“Get me to the airport tomorrow morning”</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">When does your flight leave?</p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px"><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Early</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Mid-morning</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Afternoon</span></div><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Then you change your mind</p><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0"><li style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">“Actually, I have two large bags and a kid”</li><li style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">“Actually, my flight is delayed 90 minutes”</li></ul></li>
<li style="border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-card)"><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">You say</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); line-height: 1.3">“Order dinner for tonight”</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted)">What matters most?</p><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px"><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Get it fast</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Keep it light</span><span style="border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Keep it cheap</span></div><p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 8px; font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Then you change your mind</p><ul style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0"><li style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">“Actually, my parents are joining and they're vegetarian”</li><li style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text); padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line)">“Actually, I'll cook it myself”</li></ul></li></ul>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted)">The scenarios are scripted and the prices invented, so what you judge is the interaction.</p>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="listen-title" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px">
<h2 id="listen-title" style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 13px; font-weight: var(--weight-label); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink); display: flex; gap: 14px">Listen: a voice-to-voice prototype</h2>
<div aria-hidden="true" style="flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--line)"></div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 40px 64px; align-items: flex-start">
<div style="flex: 1 1 520px"><video controls preload="none" playsinline poster="/images/noui/listen-poster.jpg" width="1440" height="988" aria-label="Recording of the noui voice-to-voice prototype: a cancelled flight is re-planned by talking to Orby" style="display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--letterbox); border-radius: var(--radius-card-lg)"><source src="/images/noui/listen-demo.mp4" type="video/mp4" />Your browser can't play this video. <a href="https://noui.si/listen/">Watch it on noui.si</a>.</video></div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 340px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--display); line-height: 1.3">Say what you need. The interface assembles itself.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px">A recorded run of a cancelled flight: the traveller talks, Orby answers, and halfway through the traveller cuts in. Orby stops at once and re-plans.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Real</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px">Speech recognition and Orby's voice run on the laptop as local models; the replies come from Anthropic's Claude.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-label); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: var(--weight-label)">Invented</p><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px">The flights and prices. Nothing is booked.</p>
<a href="https://noui.si/listen/" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none">Watch the recording<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7"></path><path d="M8 7h9v9"></path></svg></a>
